{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatestriders is a roguelike top down 2d shooter!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712220/extras/665130771ee929609c58ff0dc844262e.avif?t=1763900314\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity's homeworld has fallen to the Kaiju swarm. Now, the last survivors have reached Planet Em-8er - but this new world harbors deadly threats of its own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Mech</strong> and command one of three distinct Gatestrider units:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PRIME</strong> - Balanced all-rounder with versatile firepower.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712220/extras/fe4299318462c468571f6012bac99070.avif?t=1763900314\" width=667 height=667 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>HEAVYOBJECT</strong> - Heavy tank with devastating shotgun spreads.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712220/extras/c5a2277851f6b27a6ace13b448ec4162.avif?t=1763900314\" width=667 height=667 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WANTED</strong> - Agile sniper built for precision strikes.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3712220/extras/3452578c2ec17676b45259877e1e44ef.avif?t=1763900314\" width=667 height=667 /></span><br><br><strong>G</strong>ateStriders is a  top-down bullet heaven shooter where you pilot powerful mechs against overwhelming odds. Battle endless waves of hostile creatures in this intense top-down shooter. Upgrade your arsenal between waves, unlock devastating abilities, and adapt your tactics as enemies grow stronger and more numero